response_schema.template:
Respond with ONLY a JSON object of this exact shape:
{"title": string, "summary": string, "xpReward": number, "nodes": [{"type": "goToLocation"|"talkToNpc"|"sayPhrase"|"relocateNpc"|"listenToNpc"|"readPassage"|"speakPhrase", "npcId": string, "locationId": string, "phrase": string, "matches": [string], "instruction": string, "explain": string}], "proposedSkills": [{"id": string (format "vocab.xxx" or "grammar.xxx"), "skillType": "vocab"|"grammar", "displayJp": string, "displayEn": string, "reading": string, "npcId": string}]}
nodes must have at least one entry. Every node and proposed skill must include an allowed npcId. Every "matches" entry must be a Japanese substring the player could plausibly type or say.
